Registers an application to use voice commands on a site, allows an application to create Voice Menu objects and Voice Menu enumerators, and controls recognition of voice commands.\cell }\pard\plain \widctlpar\intbl{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0
\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cf14\cgrid {\cf0 \row }\pard\plain \s16\sa120\sl-240\slmult0\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {
