\par Calling AwakeStateSet allows the user to temporarily suspend speech recognition for a site. For example, the user might
 want to suspend speech recognition from the computer microphone during a telephone conversation and resume recognition when the conversation is finished. The user resumes recognition by speaking an appropriate command from a sleep menu -- for example, "W
ake up!"
