\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {When the application closes down it just releases all of the interfaces.
\par That's all an application has to do for minimal functionality. Keeping the text buffers synchronized is tricky, but once that problem is solved, dictation is easy. The application doesn't have to worry about any more UI.
\par Some applications might want to take advantage of even more features such as:
