ated from first to last. Each rule contains one string (inverted) or a word, and an optional switch to turn it on/off.
\par Here are subset of the capitalization rules used for Voice Dictation English:
\par }\pard\plain \s83\li360\ri360\nowidctlpar\tx0\tx959\tx1918\tx2877\tx3836\tx4795\tx5754\tx6713\tx7672\tx8631{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \f2\fs20 {\cs82\cf1 [Capital]
\par .\\period
