eling, energy floor, microphone information, share of the processor, speaker, recognition threshold, and time-out values.\cell }\pard\plain \widctlpar\intbl{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cf14\cgrid {\cf0 \row }\pard\plain 
