gnition mode, pause and resume the engine, register or release a notification interface, get the time that a byte in the audio stream was received, and convert the time to a Win32 FILETIME structure.\cell }\pard\plain 
\widctlpar\intbl{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cf14\cgrid {\cf0 \row }\pard\plain \s16\sa120\sl-240\slmult0\widctlpar\intbl{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {ISRDialogs \cell 
Displays Windows dialog boxes that allow the user to configure the speech recognition engine, such as training the engine for the microphone or the speaker's voice.\cell }\pard\plain \widctlpar\intbl{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright 
\fs20\cf14\cgrid {\cf0 \row }\pard\plain \s16\sa120\sl-240\slmult0\widctlpar\intbl{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {ISRNotifySink \cell 
Notifies an application of engine-specific events related to recognizing speech, such as a change of attributes, interference or sound, the beginning and end of an utterance, and the VU meter reading for the incoming audio stream.\cell }\pard\plain 
\widctlpar\intbl{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cf14\cgrid {\cf0 \row }\trowd \trbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw30\brdrcf11 \trbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw30\brdrcf11 \clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw30\brdrcf11 \cltxlrtb \cellx1284\clvertalt\clbrdrb
