(Optional.) Manages speaker profile information. Member functions allow an application to query, create, delete, and merge speaker profiles and transfer a speaker profile from one system to another.\cell }\pard\plain 
\widctlpar\intbl{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cf14\cgrid {\cf0 \row }\pard\plain \s16\sa120\sl-240\slmult0\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {
