\par }\pard\plain \s16\sa120\sl-240\slmult0\widctlpar\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {The ILexPronounce interface allows a user to correct words in the engine's pronunciation lexicon. The ILexPronounce interface is supported by a speech recogn
ition engine and a text-to-speech engine. It has these member functions:
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s65 \f3\fs20\cgrid \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard\plain \s65\fi-300\li300\sa120\sl-240\slmult0\widctlpar\tx300{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls75\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnhang{\pntxtb \'b7}}\ls75\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
