orresponding word is spoken, and zero is reserved for situations when the word identifier is unknown.\cell }\pard\plain \widctlpar\intbl{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cf14\cgrid {\cf0 \row }\trowd \trbrdrt
