\fs20\cgrid {Rules (SRCKCFG_RULES)\cell (required) This chunk contains a list of SRCFGRULE structures that specify the rules for the grammar.\cell }\pard\plain \widctlpar\intbl{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cf14\cgrid {\cf0 
