\par }\pard\plain \s16\sa120\sl-240\slmult0\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {Implementing DirectTextToSpeech in an application involves the use of three different objects:
\par Engine object 
\par Engine enumerator 
