}\pard\plain \widctlpar\intbl{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cf14\cgrid {\cf0 \row }\pard\plain \s16\sa120\sl-240\slmult0\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {
