ust have determined absolutely that an utterance is the recognized phrase. The optimum threshold for the average user should be 50.\cell }\pard\plain \widctlpar\intbl{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cf14\cgrid {\cf0 \row 
