\par }\pard\plain \s16\sa120\sl-240\slmult0\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {The wizard ensures that the user's microphone is plugged in and working properly.
\par Applications using speech recognition should provide users with an opportunity to run the Microphone Setup Wizard.
\par To run the Microphone Setup Wizard, the application does a CoCreateInstance on the wizard's object, CLSID_STMicWizard, and queries for the }{\b ISTMicWizard}{ interface. It then calls ISTMicWizard-Wizard(), with a set of flags specific to the application.

\par The Microphone Setup Wizard understands only }{\b ISTMicWizard}{.
