st, your application should write a new help file and replace $(WINDOWS)\\Speech\\Speech.hlp and Speech.cnt.
\par The contexts used are:
\par 232 -- Buying a microphone 
\par 235 -- Adjusting the playback volume 
\par 245 -- Microphone is too quiet. 
\par 246 -- Microphone is too loud. 
