\par ISRGramCommon (Required) 
\par Activate - Required 
\par Archive - Optional for CFG and limited domain. Required for dictation. Under dictation it must also support the archiving of results objects. 
\par BookMark - Optional (Will most likely be required in SAPI 5.0) 
\par Deactivate - Required 
\par DeteriorationGet/Set - Optional 
\par TrainDlg - Optional 
\par TrainPhrase - Optional 
\par TrainQuery - Required 
\par ISRGramDictation (Required if dictation or limited-domain supported) 
