\par UnArchive - Required for dictation. Optional for CFG and limited-domain. 
\par ISRNotifySink (Required) 
\par AttribChanged - Required 
\par Interference - Required for SRMSGINT_AUDIODATA_STARTED, SRMSGINT_AUDIODATA_STOPPED, SRMSGINT_IAUDIO_STARTED, SRMSGINT_IAUDIO_STOPPED, SRMSGINT_TOO_LOUD, and SRMSGINT_TOOQUIET. Others are optional. 
\par Sound - Optional 
